# No tinygrad PRs

Never open, create, or re-open pull requests against tinygrad/tinygrad (or other tinygrad org repos) unless the user explicitly asks in that conversation. Pushing to a personal fork branch is fine. Do not create draft PRs for shipping on your own. Only update an existing upstream PR if the user asks.
